<!DOCTYPE html><html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>CreaTIN:Generating a TIN from a point cloud</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>
<body>
 <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->
  <!--<p align="justify">Generating a TIN from a point cloud.<br/></p>-->
<!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpsopcions"/>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->
<style type="text/css">
/*<![CDATA[*/
  <!--
  .Estilo2 {
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: bold;
  }
  .Estilo5 {font-size: 16px}
  .Estilo7 {font-size: 14}
  .Estilo8 {font-size: 12px}
  -->
  /*]]>*/
</style>
  <p align="justify"> The program allows to make a selection of the input points file, as well as to use the Z coordinate of the points, in case it is a 3D file, or to use a numeric field of the database as Z coordinate that will be assigned to each vertex of the output triangles. In addition, it is also allowed to use points that have NODATA height (in case of choosing to use 3D dimension) or with empty label (in the case of assigning a field).</p>

  <p align="justify">The input file must be a point file in PNT format and the output file will be a polygon file in POL format.</p>
  
  <hr/>
<!-- Aquí inicia la part corresponent a la sintaxi de miramon. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpssintaxi"/>
